From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:04:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(food): log a meal told in words, without a photo

A Write button opens a meal with no photo; Claude reads the description alone
(amounts as given, a meat or fish weight read as raw). A meal saved without
photos can be re-analysed from its note. Notes take up to 500 characters.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
